@startuml
title UC12 - Level Up - Test Cases

map "TC-UC12-01: Pokemon levels up after battle" as TC1 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC12-01
  Test Case Name => Pokemon levels up and stats increase
  Description => Verify Pokemon levels up correctly when EXP threshold is met
  Preconditions => 1. Player won a battle \n 2. Pokemon EXP is near level threshold
  Test Case Input => Pokemon: Charmander (Lv.9, EXP: 95/100) \n EXP earned: 30
  Expected Output => 1. Charmander reaches Lv.10 \n 2. All stats recalculated (HP, Atk, Def, Spd) \n 3. Level up notification displayed \n 4. Remaining EXP: 25/120 (next level)
  Steps => 1. Battle victory awards 30 EXP \n 2. System adds EXP (95 + 30 = 125) \n 3. System detects threshold exceeded (100) \n 4. Pokemon levels up to Lv.10 \n 5. Verify stats recalculated \n 6. Verify notification displayed \n 7. Verify remaining EXP is 25
  Default Value Preserving => Pokemon level and stats updated in GameSession
}

map "TC-UC12-02: Evolution triggers on level up" as TC2 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC12-02
  Test Case Name => Pokemon evolves upon reaching evolution level
  Description => Verify Pokemon evolves correctly when evolution conditions are met
  Preconditions => 1. Player won a battle \n 2. Charmander at Lv.15, evolves at Lv.16
  Test Case Input => Pokemon: Charmander (Lv.15) \n EXP earned: sufficient for Lv.16
  Expected Output => 1. Charmander levels up to Lv.16 \n 2. Evolution triggered \n 3. Charmander transforms into Charmeleon \n 4. New stats applied
  Steps => 1. Battle victory awards EXP \n 2. Charmander reaches Lv.16 \n 3. System checks evolution conditions \n 4. Evolution condition met \n 5. System transforms via WorldGenService \n 6. Verify Pokemon is now Charmeleon \n 7. Verify new stats applied
  Default Value Preserving => Pokemon species, stats and moves updated
}

@enduml
